+KernelVersion:	v7.3
+Contact:	linux-cxl@vger.kernel.org
+Description:
+		(RO) For CXL host platforms that support "QoS Telemmetry"
+		this attribute conveys a comma delimited list of platform
+		specific cookies that identifies a QoS performance class
